# /boost

When `/boost` is specified, activate the `modes/boost-mode.md` modifier of `subagent-lane-planner`:
- Differentiate investigation (root cause tracing) from implementation (production quality).
- Conduct mandatory adversarial review of edge cases (nulls, empty collections, concurrency, error recovery).
- Refactor and address any identified deficiency before reporting completion.
